e shortest meeting is the one that was replaced by an email.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Work&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;A deadline becomes realistic immediately after it is missed.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Work&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We optimize productivity by adding another productivity tool.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Work&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The busiest calendar often has the least room for actual work.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Work&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;People buy smart devices so they can spend more time configuring them.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Daily&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Convenience is carrying five chargers for three devices.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Daily&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The quickest queue is always the one you did not choose.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Daily&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;A silent notification is still checked immediately.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Daily&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We save things for later until later needs its own storage plan.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Daily&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Humans invented maps and still ask which way the station is.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Human&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Everyone wants a simple answer to a complicated question.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Human&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Experience is knowing exactly which mistake you are repeating.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Human&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The more choices we have, the longer we spend choosing nothing.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Human&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We dislike uncertainty, so we make confident predictions about it.&quot;,&quot;tone&quot;:&quot;Human&quot;}],&quot;status&quot;:{&quot;max&quot;:&quot;Maximum reached 🚀&quot;,&quot;min&quot;:&quot;Minimum reached 🧊&quot;,&quot;high&quot;:&quot;High score territory 🔥&quot;,&quot;low&quot;:&quot;Going underground 🕳️&quot;,&quot;too_much&quot;:&quot;T